# Topic 5 · Status of Women in Pakistan

::: glance | Topic 5 at a glance
**Head VI** of the syllabus: ==8.5 visits== (eight full questions and one short note, 2017–2026), plus 19 of the 140 MCQs — mostly laws and dates. Four families: **health** (2017, 2023, 2024 — Fathalla's road); **the gender-gap ranking** (2018 "second-worst", 2026 the 2025 report); **employment and the double burden** (2019); **law and human rights** (2020). The 2026 paper added **intersectionality** and the **digital gender gap**. Every answer lives on current, dated data. Never yet asked in full: **women's education**, family law and the MFLO 1961, women in politics, climate impacts.
:::

